# Every gates/verify.sh template /factory:init ever wrote, by sha256 of its
# text normalised (CRLF -> LF, trailing blanks stripped, blank lines at either
# end dropped, one final newline, "\$N" read as "$N"). factory-upgrade replaces
# a gate that matches one of these with the shim, and never one that does not.
